{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":11,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_st02","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-5","storyName":"终将重逢","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"莫伊拉提出寻找逃生方法的计划；米兰妮为谢幕戏找蒂比设计场景；格蕾塔找到卢西恩，在结局未定的情况下希望他成为新的男主演，与此同时，陷在创作困境之中的斯蒂芬听到了敲门声......","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_05","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["蒂比","莫伊拉","米兰妮","卢西恩","格蕾塔","斯蒂芬"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"老道尔顿的死和谢莉小姐走入冷库都不是意外......","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"现在，迈克尔先生和玛丽昂小姐也死了，还是死于那样的场景和手段......","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"幕后的凶手到底是谁？为什么要犯下这么多桩命案？为什么......如此残忍？","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"迈克尔先生似乎早有预感。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"遇害的前一天晚上他来找我的时候，神情比之前几次见面还要严肃。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"他一定是确定了道尔顿的意外背后真正的原因，才心惊胆战想逃离这里，但......","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"无论他是不是心里有鬼，我们都没法知道了......","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"可能最近发生的所有事都与他们口中说的那起五年前的意外有关，但我更担心的是......","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"凶手不再将谋杀掩盖为意外，而是将自己的存在公之于众，他难道是想告诉我们——","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"在真相彻底被揭发之前，任何人都不安全。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"啊对不起，莫丽，我的话是不是吓到你了？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"别担心，无论地块上是不是游荡着穷凶极恶的杀手，无论对方有多少人，我都会保护你的。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"不，蒂比大侦探，我只是在想......我也可以做些什么。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"嗯？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"迈克尔先生已经遇难，但他之前拜托我的事情，不一定要作废。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"格蕾塔女士提到过的逃生舱或许已经被凶手盯上......","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"如果真能另开辟一条逃生通道，或者造出某种连接地面的装置，或者哪怕只是找到一个可以让我们通过的排风口......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"说不定我们真能避开那在阴影里盯着我们的凶手，在关键的时候保护自己。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽......","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"蒂比，我来到这个剧组后，你是第一个跟我说话，跟我交心的人。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我搞砸过很多事，也给你添过麻烦，但你凡事都挡在我的前面，哪怕玛丽昂只是一时忘记我的名字，你也会郑重其事地提醒。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"你一直在关心我、安慰我、保护我......","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"现在，我也想保护你。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"......","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,0","duration":"1","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"6","vibrato":"5","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":55},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"黎博利女孩轻轻抱住她在剧组里最最要好的朋友。","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"等这些事结束了，我们到你家去看电影......二十四小时恐怖片连播，搭配我们最喜欢的饮料和炸鳞块。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我想见见你从小长大的地方，也想看看你温柔的姐姐究竟是什么样子。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......好。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":63},{"type":"charslot","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":65},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":67},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我似乎打扰了你们温情的姐妹谈心。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"米兰妮女士，您怎么会亲自来道具间？您的助理呢？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#6$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"你们没收到格蕾塔的终端通讯吗？她结算了所有人的酬劳，正式解散了整个剧组。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"畏惧凶手的，忌惮天灾的，坚持拍摄的......都可以任意决定自己的去留，各行其是。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"眨眼的功夫，我手下那个软骨头就不知道跑哪儿躲起来了。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/43/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"各行其是？","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"有那么多人遇害了......难道格蕾塔女士，不，剧组的其他人都不在意这背后深层的原因是什么吗？","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#4$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"深层原因？在这种情况下难道还有人想要追寻真相吗？直接逃离移动地块报警不是更方便吗？","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"或者，按照格蕾塔的说法——把真相交给想当侦探的好事者吧。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那您来找我们又是为了什么？","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"不是你们，是你，场景喷绘师蒂比。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"我欣赏格蕾塔想要拍摄天灾的胆识，她的铤而走险对于我个人来说也是极佳的机遇，但戏不是光靠天然的背景就能撑起来的。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"蒂比，我知道你对电影的热情远超剧组里的大多数成员，你也多少听说过这个项目对我有多么重要......","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1830_1#2$1","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米兰妮","text":"所以，我真诚地请求你发挥在氛围营造和色彩搭配上的天赋，为我的谢幕戏设计最完美的场景。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1830_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"哇......","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我是很愿意啦，但......","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$2","duration":"1","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"蒂比，你去帮米兰妮女士的忙吧。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"欸，莫丽，你穿上雨披是要......你真打算去，“探险”啊？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$2","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"嗯。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"放心，我在道具组也待了这么久，对地块也算熟悉，不会出什么事的。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"还记得我们刚刚说过的话吗？这是我必须要去做的事情。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1e/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那好吧。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"等我帮完米兰妮女士，就去找你！","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":117},{"type":"dialog","id":118},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"charslot","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":122},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_62_g10_dormitory.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":123},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":127},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":128,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"请进，格蕾塔女士。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"还没开门就知道是我了？","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"嗯，我在等你。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"......","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"那天你暗地里调查出的小线索，让我不得不提前向所有成员解释拍摄实景天灾的规划。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"那不是个好时机。阿布纳，还有剧组的其他人本就对我不满，我只能临时做了一些不可谓不大的决定。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"如果要较真，我甚至能以侵占他人财物罪将你告上法庭，卢西恩。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"但是？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"但是我不会只为了树立威信或是宣泄情绪惩罚我的员工，当时追究你的过错毫无意义。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"之后剧组又发生了命案，凶手甚至不再掩饰自己的暴行。大家惊慌失措，你却还像往常一样，远离人群冷静旁观。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"在这样的危机之中我才终于确认，你来这里另有目的。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"......","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"不过，这些都已经不重要了。剧组已经解散，无论你打算离开，还是留到合约结束，随你心意。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你的戏份已经结束了。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"不。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#2$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"格蕾塔女士，此刻你来找我，恰好证明我的戏份还没结束。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#1$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"......我没办法临时变出另一个“杜邦夫人”，也没办法让三个“洛克菲勒”死而复生。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"时间和人手都已经所剩无几，我必须在有限的资源中找到最优解。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"卢西恩先生，接下来，我想让你来担当主演。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":163},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":164},{"type":"charslot","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":166},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_bg_62_g13_directorstudio.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_typewriter","text":"","id":170},{"type":"text","text":"深夜的办公室，粗暴的打字声回响着。","id":171},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_burnpaper","id":172},{"type":"text","text":"满脸颓丧的佩洛男子蜷缩在打字机前，他扫了一眼最新的那张剧稿，将烟头按了上去。","id":173},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":175},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"结局、结局、结局......","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"杜邦夫人应该在结局死去......","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“她跟第二个洛克菲勒私奔后，两人断绝了一切与外界的联系，诗意地栖居在乡野。”","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“然而贵族生活在洛克菲勒身上遗留的痕迹太重，他羞辱了杜邦夫人虚假的姓氏后离开了她，杜邦夫人在绝望中自刎......”","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"太写实......","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"离开奢靡生活后一定要受罚？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#5$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"那可是哥伦比亚历史中最视财富为美德的时代，我要的是还原它，让观众评价它，而不是自己在电影中批判它！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":186},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rollpaper","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"烟头烫出的伤痕吞没了整张剧稿，斯蒂芬用力将灰烬吹走。","id":188},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“杜邦夫人最终没有选择任何一个洛克菲勒，她本就想借恋人的名义逃脱虚假的命运，却错估了爱情的毒性。”","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“洛克菲勒兄弟不约而同策划了三种复仇方式，最终杜邦夫人被三人同时杀死......”","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"太庸俗......","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"不做选择依旧陷入爱情的泥沼，看似是某种因果和宿命，实际上只是生搬硬套。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"最后杜邦夫人尸骨无存的画面震撼力倒是有了，但情节也太粗糙......","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#1$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“杜邦夫人的家族冒充维多利亚贵族的真相最终还是暴露在公众之前，无论三位洛克菲勒的爱有多深，他们都无法保护她免于制裁。”","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“杜邦夫人人生中唯一一次真正享受贵族待遇的时刻，是真正的杜邦家族为她施加死刑之时......”","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"太......工整！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#5$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"精心编排，寻求表意，最后恰恰缺乏《杜邦夫人之死》里该有的疯狂和浪漫......！","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#7$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"啧，怎么稿纸又没了，还得去文件柜里拿......","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"10","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"100,-60","duration":"0.5","id":207},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"啊！","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"斯蒂芬踩到被他扔在地上的纸团，仰天栽倒。","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"这时他才意识到这间办公室已经被他废弃的剧稿淹没，无处下脚。","id":212},{"type":"text","text":"他躺在枯竭的灵感中央，双手捂住脸，崩溃大吼。","id":213},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"斯蒂芬·奎你*蓝卡坞片场术语*清醒一点！整整两个月你都在修改结局，到现在连个勉强能用的桥段都没有！","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"这是你的原创剧本，是你一字一句斟酌出来的故事，难道最后你连自己想写的是什么都不知道吗？！","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"如果说痛苦才能孵化经典，现在不正是你应当走向创作巅峰的时刻吗？","id":217},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"拍摄即将结束的压力，听到即将拍摄天灾的冲击，凶手连环作案带来的恐惧......什么都有了！你还差什么？","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"“灵感之神”？哈！","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"那只是你搪塞格蕾塔女士的说辞......你的神不会来的，你们已经失联很久了！","id":221},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"......谁啊......","id":226},{"type":"dialog","id":227},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1835_1#4$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,-60","posto":"0,0","id":231},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯蒂芬","text":"......只要能让我想出结尾，是谁都行。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_1835_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":236},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":238},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":240},{"type":"image","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242}],"characters":["蒂比","莫伊拉","米兰妮","卢西恩","格蕾塔","斯蒂芬"]}